.TH CSTR_RFIND 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cstr_rfind \- find the last occurrence of a substring
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cstring.h>

cstr_rfind(s, needle);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Pass-through wrapper for cstring_rfind().
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s        cstr to search
needle   Substring to find
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
Zero-based index of last occurrence, or ccol_invalid_size if not found
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstring_rfind (3),
.BR cstr_find (3)
